# Cloudflare Pages redirects for frontend PR previews.
# Copied into dist/ only for preview builds (VITE_DEPLOY_ENV=preview or CF_PAGES).
#
# Static JSON under /preview-api is a read-only mock. POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE are
# not rewritten and return 404/405 from Pages, so previews cannot write to the
# production database or call Stripe live mode.
#
# SPA fallback is last. Specific API rewrites must stay above it.

/preview-api/models /preview-api/models.json 200
/preview-api/credits/balance /preview-api/credits-balance.json 200
/preview-api/rate-limit-status /preview-api/rate-limit-status.json 200
